GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/urlscanner/v2/responses/{response_id}
Returns the raw response of the network request. Find the `response_id` in the `data.requests.response.hash`.
Required: response_id (path) — Response hash.; account_id (path) — Account ID.

